  <!-- SECTION: pledge.Pledge statement -->
  <div data-screen-label="Pledge statement">
    <div class="pl-line"><i></i><p>I believe living should not have a price tag.</p></div>
    <div class="pl-line"><i></i><p>I believe technology should make life cheaper for everyone — not concentrate wealth for a few.</p></div>
    <div class="pl-line"><i></i><p>I support using AI, robotics, and open tools to lower the real cost of food, shelter, energy, and the other essentials of a decent life.</p></div>
    <div class="pl-line"><i></i><p>I stand for work that is a choice, not a sentence served just to survive.</p></div>
    <div class="pl-line"><i></i><p>I add my name to call for a world where the basics of life are within everyone&rsquo;s reach.</p></div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION: pledge.What happens when you sign -->
